<view class="page"><view class="title">收款与提现</view><view class="card"><view class="muted">可用 ¥{{hidden ? '••••' : (wallet.balance || '—')}} · 冻结 ¥{{hidden ? '••••' : (wallet.frozenBalance || '—')}}</view><view wx:if="{{wallet.debtBalance !== '0.00'}}" class="gain spaced">退款待追偿 ¥{{hidden ? '••••' : (wallet.debtBalance || '—')}}</view><button class="secondary spaced" bindtap="bindWechat">关联本人微信零钱</button><picker range="{{accounts}}" range-key="label" bindchange="selectAccount"><view class="pill spaced">选择已关联的收款账户 ▾</view></picker><input class="input spaced mono" type="digit" value="{{amount}}" bindinput="onAmount" placeholder="提现金额，最多两位小数"/><button class="button spaced" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !accountId || !wallet || wallet.debtBalance !== '0.00'}}" bindtap="submit">提交提现申请</button><view class="muted small spaced">申请后冻结余额，审核付款后记录真实流水。渠道未付款前不视为到账。</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="strong spaced">提现记录</view><view class="card activity" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><view class="activity-main"><view class="mono gain">¥{{hidden ? '••••' : (item.amount)}}</view><view class="muted small">{{item.createdAt}}</view></view><view class="pill">{{item.status}}</view></view><view class="tabs"><button class="secondary" disabled="{{page === 1}}" bindtap="previous">上一页</button><button class="secondary" disabled="{{page*20 >= total}}" bindtap="next">下一页</button></view></view>
